  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Card Casting, Outburst Spell</p>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong> You may designate any number of effect cards in your deck as crashing effect cards. Crashing effect cards cannot be cast normally but are considered to cost 2 fewer spell points than their normal cost for the purpose of being revealed and cast with the Outburst Spell metamagic feat.</p>\n<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Card Casting 3: Volatile Variance</sup></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/card-and-deck-feats#toc17\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
